    "detailed_description": "<i>Munchie Strikers</i> is a chaotic arcade-style soccer/fighting multiplayer game with simple controls and unique fields filled with obstacles and danger. <br><br>A group of ambitious jinn fight tooth and nail to snatch the ball and score against their opponents in a world of epic battles and fierce competition. With hazardous elements lurking around every corner, every move counts in this high-stakes game of skill and strategy. Do you have what it takes to emerge victorious and become the ruler of the Earth?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439670/extras/3625d2926a4d02d8bdad327aaf0a9275.poster.avif?t=1747454466\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439670/extras/3625d2926a4d02d8bdad327aaf0a9275.webm?t=1747454466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439670/extras/3625d2926a4d02d8bdad327aaf0a9275.mp4?t=1747454466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uniquely designed fields that transform into chaotic and dangerous fighting arenas.<br></li><li> High-stakes matches where up to eight different teams battle against each other.<br></li><li> Obstacles, hazards, items, and map objects that can significantly impact your strategy from match to match.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Munchie Strikers</i> is a chaotic arcade-style soccer/fighting multiplayer game with simple controls and unique fields filled with obstacles and danger. <br><br>A group of ambitious jinn fight tooth and nail to snatch the ball and score against their opponents in a world of epic battles and fierce competition. With hazardous elements lurking around every corner, every move counts in this high-stakes game of skill and strategy. Do you have what it takes to emerge victorious and become the ruler of the Earth?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439670/extras/3625d2926a4d02d8bdad327aaf0a9275.poster.avif?t=1747454466\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439670/extras/3625d2926a4d02d8bdad327aaf0a9275.webm?t=1747454466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439670/extras/3625d2926a4d02d8bdad327aaf0a9275.mp4?t=1747454466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uniquely designed fields that transform into chaotic and dangerous fighting arenas.<br></li><li> High-stakes matches where up to eight different teams battle against each other.<br></li><li> Obstacles, hazards, items, and map objects that can significantly impact your strategy from match to match.</li></ul>",
